<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CEN BANK JUNE 4-11 REPO AVERAGE YIELD 45 PCT.</title>
<headline>CZECH CEN BANK JUNE 4-11 REPO AVERAGE YIELD 45 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield in a Czech National Bank's (CNB) one-week (June 4 to 11) reverse repo tender draining liquidity from the market on Monday reached the limit rate of 45 percent, the CNB said.</p>
</text>
